protobuf-c (1.1.0.rw.10-0ubuntu1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Port to Ubuntu 26.04 (GCC 15, protobuf 3.21).
  * Backport upstream runtime security fixes, including CVE-2022-48468.
  * Make "make check" pass and run it during the package build.
  * Replace the manual -dbg package with an automatic -dbgsym package.
  * libprotobuf-c-dev: depend on libglib2.0-dev; the headers and .pc need it.

